<title>MALAYSIA: Ringgit reacts positively to 1997 budget.</title>
<headline>Ringgit reacts positively to 1997 budget.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The ringgit reacted positively to the announcement of the 1997 Budget, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Generally we like what we see,&quot; said a local currency dealer. &quot;Trading has been choppy, but the bias is towards the ringgit,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;Much of the budget has already been accounted for,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>Dealers said they saw the ringgit heading towards the 2.5030/40 range towards the close of trading on Friday.</p>
</text>
